{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "SPEC-0049 §126-§128 regression budgets. Every number here must come from measured history on the reference hardware, never from a guess: §127 forbids hardcoding universal thresholds without historical data. Until a release has a measured baseline on this hardware, a metric belongs out of this file, where it is reported as Undetermined instead of silently passing.",
